      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you have a bug with a POC of the issue fixed here? I\u0027m not sure I understand what the issue is.\n\nrequestListeningState should always be called with a context of the current user.",
      "revId": "3a68e89a6b1923f3f0654a01f1f0010143a57038",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1baea9de_e0a6e54c",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
